msgid "Smart Batteries"
msgstr "智能电池"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-landingpage.rst:7
#: 1f70408460bc40f6b2a048a87e302a7a
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports several types of \"smart battery\" that communicate using"
" `SMBus <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/System_Management_Bus>`__:"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 支持多种通过 `SMBus "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/System_Management_Bus>`__ 通信的「智能电池」："

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-landingpage.rst:9
#: ab87ea38186f451896ef485864fe8e30
msgid ""
"the `Solo battery <https://www.amazon.com/Solo-Smart-Battery-Rechargeable-"
"Lithium/dp/B01LWAAMV3>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Solo 电池 <https://www.amazon.com/Solo-Smart-Battery-Rechargeable-"
"Lithium/dp/B01LWAAMV3>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-landingpage.rst:10
#: b02cd45d21b54891a6616d0863ca8ffd
msgid "Maxell"
msgstr "Maxell"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-landingpage.rst:11
#: 4a26a0bb4cae46ffbc4b67beb2903275
msgid ":ref:`Royote<common-smart-battery-rotoye>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Royote<common-smart-battery-rotoye>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-landingpage.rst:12
#: 0bd7b54b80994a56be00fce5f4e160b5
msgid "Generic support for SUI3 and SUI6 SMBus batteries"
msgstr "通用 SUI3 和 SUI6 SMBus 电池支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-landingpage.rst:14
#: 6a08c5e41d6a4ea9a6672b8940a07d25
msgid ""
"While not yet very common, smart batteries are easier to attach and detach "
"from the vehicle and are capable of providing more information on the state "
"of the battery including capacity, individual cell voltages, temperature, "
"etc."
msgstr "智能电池目前虽不十分普及，但其安装拆卸更为方便，且能提供更多电池状态信息，包括容量、各单体电压、温度等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-landingpage.rst:22
#: 3dbf6bfd3fd84577a279104efc12d5e8
msgid "Setup through Mission Planner"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-landingpage.rst:27
#: 72c7c97ac78b48f8b7614f06cae33844
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` to appropriate Smart Battery model "
"Set :ref:`BATT_I2C_BUS <BATT_I2C_BUS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>` to the "
"appropriate bus number"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` 设置为适当的智能电池型号，并将 :ref:`BATT_I2C_BUS "
"<BATT_I2C_BUS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>` 设置为适当的总线编号"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-landingpage.rst:30
#: 74547ea00eac47cea5167d1288b9c124
msgid ""
"For adding more batteries, set :ref:`BATT2_MONITOR <BATT2_MONITOR>` & "
":ref:`BATT2_I2C_BUS <BATT2_I2C_BUS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>`, "
":ref:`BATT3_MONITOR <BATT3_MONITOR>` & :ref:`BATT3_I2C_BUS "
"<BATT3_I2C_BUS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>`,etc."
msgstr ""
"如需添加更多电池，请设置 :ref:`BATT2_MONITOR <BATT2_MONITOR>` 和 :ref:`BATT2_I2C_BUS "
"<BATT2_I2C_BUS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>`、:ref:`BATT3_MONITOR <BATT3_MONITOR>`"
" 和 :ref:`BATT3_I2C_BUS <BATT3_I2C_BUS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>` 等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-landingpage.rst:32
#: b7adb14b3db3495297fca4f4b63d9edc
msgid ""
"Restart the board and connect with a ground station and check the battery "
"voltage appears. The :ref:`BATT_CAPACITY <BATT_CAPACITY>` parameter should "
"be automatically updated to the batteries actual capacity in mAh."
msgstr ""
"重启主板并使用地面站连接，检查电池电压是否显示。:ref:`BATT_CAPACITY <BATT_CAPACITY>` "
"参数应自动更新为电池的实际容量（mAh）。"

